@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Historial 6: GET /api/v1/supervisor/reports/transport-orders/:orderId/export (Exportación Excel y Acta Oficial PDF)

actor "Supervisor / Auditor" as User
participant "App Web (Frontend)" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Revision Export Service" as Service
participant "Excel / PDF Generator" as Generator
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "count_sessions DB\n(transport_order_count_sessions)" as SessionDB
participant "session_items DB\n(transport_order_count_session_items)" as SessionItemsDB
participant "truck_inventories DB" as InvDB

== Flujo A: Exportar Matriz Comparativa a Excel / CSV ==

User -> Web: Clic en "Exportar Matriz Excel"
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/supervisor/reports/transport-orders/100451/export-excel
Gateway -> Service: generateOrderExcelReport(orderId: 100451)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findOrderHeader(100451)
OrdersDB --> Service: orderHeader

Service -> SessionDB: 2. findSessionsByOrderId(100451)
SessionDB --> Service: sessions[]

Service -> SessionItemsDB: 3. findSessionItems(sessionIds)
SessionItemsDB --> Service: sessionItems[]

Service -> InvDB: 4. findTruckInventories(100451)
InvDB --> Service: truckInventories[]

Service -> Generator: 5. buildCsvContent(orderHeader, sessions, sessionItems, truckInventories)
note right of Generator
  Genera CSV UTF-8 BOM:
  - Metadatos: OT, Fecha, Camión, Chofer, Supervisor
  - Matriz: Producto, Factor, Esperado, Conteo Chofer,
    Revisión Sup, Semáforo, Carga Final Oficial
end note
Generator --> Service: csvBuffer / stream

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (Content-Type: text/csv; filename="Acta_Liquidacion_100451.csv")
Gateway --> Web: File Download Stream
Web --> User: Descarga automática del archivo .csv en el navegador

== Flujo B: Descargar Acta Oficial en PDF ==

User -> Web: Clic en "Descargar PDF" (en pestaña Liquidación)
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/supervisor/reports/transport-orders/100451/acta-pdf
Gateway -> Service: generateOfficialActaPdf(orderId: 100451)

Service -> OrdersDB: 6. findOrderHeader(100451)
OrdersDB --> Service: orderHeader

Service -> InvDB: 7. findOfficialInventoryWithSignatures(100451)
InvDB --> Service: officialInventoryWithSignatures

Service -> Generator: 8. renderPdfWithVectorSignatures(orderHeader, officialInventoryWithSignatures)
note right of Generator
  Genera documento PDF vectorizado:
  - Encabezado oficial Grupo Venado
  - Datos de transporte y vehículo
  - Tabla de productos conciliados
  - Firmas digitales SVG renderizadas
  - Sello oficial de rampa
end note
Generator --> Service: pdfBuffer

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (Content-Type: application/pdf; filename="Acta_Despacho_100451.pdf")
Gateway --> Web: PDF Binary Stream
Web --> User: Abre visor PDF o descarga el documento legal
@enduml
